7
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:20.770
Joey, you have a wonderful accent.

8
00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.020
Thank you.

9
00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:26.410
Joey, are you sure you're in the right place ?

10
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:30.650
Oh, I'm in the right place.

11
00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:32.960
Let's get  started.

12
00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:34.400
- One. - One.

13
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.960
Two... Three...

14
00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:40.050
Four... Five...

15
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.310
Six... Seven...

16
00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:47.490
Eight... Nine... Ten !

17
00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:49.800
Eleven,  Twelve.

18
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.030
Very good, Boris.

19
00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:54.360
thanks, thanks.

20
00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:56.580
13, 14, 15.

21
00:01:00.230 --> 00:01:02.440
[Music]

22
00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:06.000
Oh, Joey. Your English so good.

23
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.240
Can you say  more words for me ?

24
00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:09.250
Uh...

25
00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.230
"Corduroy."

26
00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:12.960
Give me another.

27
00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:15.760
"Harpsichord."

28
00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:17.100
Oh, yes.

29
00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:18.390
Now this is  a big one.

30
00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:20.190
Don't do it. It's too dangerous !

31
00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:24.890
"Ibuprofen."

32
00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:27.120
Get the check.

33
00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:32.720
What happened to you ? I had to call Alex for a ride.

34
00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:36.350
Oh, my God ! What a body !

35
00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:41.160
I haven't felt this way since gymnastics camp.

36
00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:42.520
Hey, Maria !

37
00:01:43.690 --> 00:01:46.570
Take me to the car, you sexy bastard.

38
00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:51.880
[Music]

39
00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:57.480
Bill... and Mary go to

40
